"stance":"rejects","claim":"Al-Rāzī’s school counters the Muʿtazilite inference with 7:179, which says God created some for Hell.","anchor":"وعارضهم أصحابنا بقوله تعالى ولقد ذرأنا لجهنم","mentions":["7:179"]},{"verses":["25:1"],"words":["تبارك"],"type":"rhetoric","speaker":"author","stance":"holds","claim":"Although warning brings fear, it fits the blessing theme like disciplining a child: greater warning can bring greater return to God and lasting happiness, directing attention to religious rather than worldly benefit.","anchor":"كلما كان الإنذار كثيرا كان رجوع الخلق إلى الله أكثر فكانت السعادة الأخروية أتم وأكثر","mentions":[]}]}
